<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Lamar said rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lamar said rated outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it started coverage of Lamar Advertising Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-5/8 to 27-1/2.</p>
<p>-- The company went public last year at $16 a share.</p>
</text>
